<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> When ftp prompts you for your user name, type "anonymous"
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> When it prompts you for a password, type "guest"
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> When it gives you the prompt, type "type binary" (to allow 
binary transfer)
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> Then type "cd /pub"
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> Now, I am assuming that you started this from wherever you 
want to put the FORTH (where in the directory structure, that is)
